OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after being hit by car in
OL,4,AFife town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 48-year-old man has died after being
OL,7,Fhit by a car in a Fife town.
OL,9,FPolice were called to Lumphinnans Road
OL,10,Fin Lochgelly at about 01:30, where the
OL,11,Fpedestrian was pronounced dead at the
OL,12,Fscene.
OL,14,FThe crash involved a black Volkswagen
OL,15,FGolf and the male driver, aged 28, was
OL,16,Farrested in connection with a road
OL,17,Ftraffic offence.
OL,19,FPolice said inquiries were ongoing and
OL,20,Furged anyone with information to
OL,21,Fcontact them.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
